id: SAVE1-2
package: fandhe-workshop-core
test: history_replay
target: crates/core/src/history_replay.rs
find:         HistoryOp::Engine(op) => state = apply(ir, state, op.clone()).0,
replace:         HistoryOp::Engine(op) => if !matches!(op, Op::Control(_)) { state = apply(ir, state, op.clone()).0 },
expect-fail: scripted_history_replays_to_snapshot
expect-fail: property_replay_matches_snapshot_fixed
expect-fail: property_replay_matches_snapshot_guided
note: 適用し直しで Control の操作を適用しない（試作の X-3 相当。記録側と適用し直しの遷移が食い違う）
